    "detailed_description": "This is a survival game based on realistic themes in a Chinese emotional intelligence setting, akin to the &quot;Souls&quot; series. Choose from 1.4 billion people the talented coach who can lead the national team to win the World Cup.<br><br>Balance the demands of the football association, players, fans, and finances, while integrating gameplay similar to &quot;Papers, Please&quot; to filter the right players into the team and avoid missteps that lead to bizarre dismissals.<br><br>The game features countless ways Chinese national football team coaches can be fired, alongside a wealth of &quot;real&quot; animated performances, allowing you to experience the harsh realities of Chinese football. This game is truly &quot;Souls-like&quot; in difficulty, discouraging novice players.<br><br>If you persist against all odds, avoiding numerous pitfalls and striving to lead the national team to World Cup glory, then perhaps you are the never-to-be-fired genius coach we've been searching for!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021330/extras/a8d2e6f92aa4dd155f1ff139b3f0b668.avif?t=1722250020\" width=600 height=360 /></span><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021330/extras/323778c09b99d95e5722fdc4639502b1.avif?t=1722250020\" width=570 height=73 /></span><br><br>In the game &quot;Coach, Please,&quot; various &quot;talents&quot; are eager to join the national team. You need to carefully scrutinize their words and decide whether to allow them into the team. A wrong decision could have serious consequences!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021330/extras/ad964d83f8766024ad8e888d1f4b3af1.avif?t=1722250020\" width=600 height=357 /></span><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021330/extras/51c816d836e4075e6463ffd59155faef.avif?t=1722250020\" width=570 height=73 /></span><br><br>Being a coach is about more than just managing the team. When players are injured, you'll need to use acupuncture treatments, and if your superiors are dissatisfied, you must offer massage and foot therapy services. Countless challenges that you could never anticipate are waiting for you. However, all these are essential steps on the road to winning the World Cup!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021330/extras/31701ad25378ca9c9ff9687aa564a7c2.avif?t=1722250020\" width=600 height=294 /></span><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021330/extras/ea649081ae71ceba4051d28ab57f5ea0.avif?t=1722250020\" width=570 height=73 /></span><br><br>Without some PR skills, it's impossible to be a good national football team coach. There's a lot of malice towards men's football in the world, so you need to be even more patient!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021330/extras/19ffd70bac828525b066a601bc191833.avif?t=1722250020\" width=600 height=326 /></span><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021330/extras/51848406a1e3e4e1cb802664c634b5d8.avif?t=1722250020\" width=570 height=73 /></span><br><br>While it's enviable to see other players win the World Cup, the bizarre dismissal endings they unlock might be even more heart-wrenching!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021330/extras/9ef19840f28db1182b98d29e47b2a5d2.avif?t=1722250020\" width=600 height=410 /></span><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021330/extras/1a1d8ffc248bae56208dfc0813a51005.avif?t=1722250020\" width=570 height=73 /></span><br><br>Every match features live commentary performances, with no need for a sports VIP subscription or 90-second ads\u2014just click and watch!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021330/extras/6f191f4168957d10c49a27771506c316.avif?t=1722250020\" width=600 height=331 /></span>",
